---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About - PickMyAITools"
  description="Hi, I'm Nadine de Jong. I review AI tools the way I test software: hands-on, skeptical, focused on what actually works for freelancers, small businesses, and working professionals."
  canonical="/about"
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12 max-w-3xl">
    <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <h1>About</h1>

      <p class="body-lead text-xl">
        Hi, I'm Nadine de Jong — the person behind PickMyAITools.
      </p>

      <p>
        I review AI tools the way I test software: hands-on, skeptical, and
        focused on what actually works in real conditions. My background is a
        mix of online marketing (Google Ads, SEO), software development, and
        QA — currently as a freelance QA specialist for a major retail
        company.
      </p>

      <p>
        That combination shapes how I evaluate AI tools. I notice the bugs
        marketing pages don't mention. I care whether tools handle EU/GDPR
        properly, because most of my readers are based in Europe. And as a
        working mother, I care about tools that actually save time — not
        ones that just look impressive in demos.
      </p>

      <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Reviews based on hands-on use, not press releases</li>
        <li>Comparisons that name the trade-offs, not just the features</li>
        <li>A Task-to-Tool Matcher that recommends tools based on what you actually want to accomplish</li>
        <li>A focus on tools that are realistic for freelancers, small businesses, and working professionals — not enterprise-only platforms</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What you won't find here</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Generic "top 10" lists rewritten from other sites</li>
        <li>AI-generated content presented as personal experience</li>
        <li>Tools recommended just because they pay the highest commission</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        The site is actively being rebuilt with this approach. If you spot
        something off, tell me — I'd rather hear it from you than from a
        reader who just clicks away.
      </p>

      <h2>Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        PickMyAITools earns affiliate commissions when readers sign up for
        tools through links on this site. This never influences whether a
        tool is recommended, only which ones I bother reviewing in the first
        place. Read the full <a href="/affiliate-disclaimer">affiliate
        disclosure</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions, corrections, or tool suggestions are welcome:
        <a href="mailto:nadine@pickmyaitools.com">nadine@pickmyaitools.com</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
